```
flowchart LR

    %% Main Nodes
    A[User Request] 
    B[Web / Mobile UI] 
    C[BFF Layer] 
    D[API Gateway] 
    E[Auth Service] 
    F[User Service] 
    G[Order Service] 
    H[Payment Service] 
    I[Notification Service] 
    J[Database]

    %% Note Node
    N[[NOTE: All services are stateless<br/>JWT used for authentication]]

    %% Connections with dual text
    A --|Clicks Button / Submits Form|--> B
    B --|HTTP Call / JSON Payload|--> C
    C --|Aggregate Data / Transform Response|--> D
    D --|Validate JWT / Check Role|--> E
    E --|Auth OK / Return Claims|--> D
    D --|Fetch Profile / Get Metadata|--> F
    D --|Create Order / Validate Items|--> G
    G --|Charge Card / Verify Funds|--> H
    H --|Payment Success / Generate Receipt|--> I
    F --|Read / Write|--> J
    G --|Persist Order / Update Status|--> J
    I --|Send Email / Push Notification|--> A

    %% Note linkage
    N -.-> D
    N -.-> E

    %% Styling
    classDef frontend fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1E88E5,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;
    classDef gateway fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#43A047,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;
    classDef service fill:#FFF8E1,stroke:#FB8C00,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;
    classDef database fill:#F3E5F5,stroke:#8E24AA,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;
    classDef note fill:#ECEFF1,stroke:#546E7A,stroke-dasharray: 5 5,color:#000;

    class A,B frontend;
    class C,D gateway;
    class E,F,G,H,I service;
    class J database;
    class N note;
```
